anned from attending stadiums for five years, De Tommaso was arrested in September with four other ultras for their involvement in the Coppa Italia final, with charges including “throwing hazardous materials and invasion of a pitch at a sporting event”. On the one hand there is no place for such criminal behaviour, let alone in football. </p>";s:7:"keyword";s:21:"ultras napoli curva a";s:5:"links";s:8434:"<a href='https://backyard.synpat.com/site/article.php?page=legxercise-pro-decathlon-88a0eb'>Legxercise Pro Decathlon</a>,
